# Compat fixtures regenerate their install state every run. The
# fixture's `package.json` is the source of truth; everything below is
# generated by `npm install` / `pnpm install` / `knot install` and
# must not be committed.
#
# `node_modules/` and `.dart_tool/` are already ignored at the repo
# root; lockfiles need fixture-scoped rules because at the root knot
# itself emits `package-lock.json` as a deliverable.
compat_test/fixtures/*/package-lock.json
compat_test/fixtures/*/pnpm-lock.yaml
compat_test/fixtures/*/knot-lock.yaml
